Input: power up, wait for 100 milliseconds and then power down. Then wait for 50 milliseconds and power up again. Then wait for READY state and then powedown again.

Output:
```
power_up;
#100ms;
power_down;
#50ms;
power_up;
WaitForREADYState;
power_down;
```

